{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_03",
  "title": "黄金萝卜",
  "storyCode": "DT-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ec40333a7dfd617076b313641bd34665172832bd4e2acd74401799b8e9edac99",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "......小心！我们好像是掉进矿洞里了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "按刚才那个工人的说法，源石虫已经在这个矿洞里建起自己的巢穴了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "因为工厂快要倒闭了，所以这里就被源石虫占领了吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "这里有赤金源石虫吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "那边的那群看起来只是普通的源石虫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "趁它们还没发现我们，快走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "......这里也没有赤金源石虫，老夫看了，都是普通的品种。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "《鲍勃的美食指南》上写赤金源石虫是荒野上的常见品种，“生活在岩石缝或者是洞穴中”“与其他品种的源石虫生活习性相同”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "在这里应该就能找到的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......你没有感觉到自己的脑袋上有东西吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯？啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这只是源石虫的幼虫，它的甲壳部分刚刚长成，现在还是比较柔软的状态。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "加上它正在努力分泌黏液固化甲壳，所以体温上升了不少，让它趴在头上还挺舒服的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "玛露西尔要不要试一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......不要！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "再往里走感觉就有些不妙了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "除了源石虫，好像还有别的生物在那里活动的声音......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "我们就在这里返回吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "可是还没找到赤金源石虫......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......这里真的有这个品种吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "或许赤金源石虫的分泌物用金色的粉就能代替呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "再深入一点点吧，老夫不想让那些真心期盼黄金萝卜的年轻人失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "而且，找到了赤金源石虫，说不定就能买那辆车了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "嘘，你们脚步声轻一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "后面还有一群，也不像是赤金源石虫啊......都不是金色的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "那是什么......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "——是酸液源石虫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "大鲍勃说过，这东西的黏液腐蚀性很强！小心不要被黏液溅到！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "玛露西尔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "知道了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "不要使用太大的魔法把它们一下子全都杀死了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "顾、顾不上了啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "（咒语）——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "召唤术？不行，完全来不及！防御魔法？魔力好像不太够......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "可恶，在这里用法杖的话我的魔法还是无法顺畅地施展......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "对了，闪光魔法......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "再试一下用手电筒吧——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "既然之前老板能用它放出闪光，那拿它来增强闪光魔法应该没什么问题吧......？不过闪光魔法对这群魔物有没有用......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "玛露西尔！快！源石虫越来越多了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "没时间再想了，就是现在......闪光——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克&莱欧斯",
      "text": "呜哇！！居然一下子全都解决了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "啊！成功了！我好像有点明白这里的魔法是怎么回事了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "太好了手电筒！你是我在这里第一个成功使用的魔法器具！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "现在可不是想这些的时候！它们的黏液被弄得到处都是啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "小心！别让它接触到皮肤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "等等，手电筒它......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "D32钢手电筒顶端凝聚着的光芒暗淡了下来，原本正常运行着的零件冒出不妙的火花，嗞嗞作响。\n还没等玛露西尔反应过来，手电筒冒出滚滚浓烟，掉在了地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "手电筒......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "玛露西尔！别愣着了！你身上也溅到黏液了啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "呜呜......我的手电筒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "好像坏了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "要不我们待会儿回去让那个老板帮你看看怎么修一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "呜呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "嗯......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "......这个黏液的这种气味......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "好好闻的味道，和之前的黏液闻起来很不一样，更像是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "这个......酸酸甜甜的味道！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "呃......你们别随便乱吃虫子的黏液啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯......是酸甜的，味道确实很不错！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "颜色也很好看，金灿灿的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "金色......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "被用D32钢手电筒释放的魔法影响，黏液的颜色变成了金色，味道也很不错......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "老夫觉得它们或许可以当成赤金源石虫的代替品！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "唔......原本有腐蚀性的黏液在魔法的影响下变得可以食用了，好神奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "但原本这种黏液是储存在源石虫体内的，我们得先把它们收集起来，再把它们做成这种可以食用的液体才行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "别告诉我你们要收集已经掉在地上的这些......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "不，做料理的食材肯定要保证是健康干净的。地上的老夫只是尝一下，并不会用它做料理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "而且，量也不够。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "要是想确保能做出黄金萝卜，还是要收集还在源石虫体内的黏液才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "要怎么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "刚刚那些源石虫已经被玛露西尔的魔法吓退了，我们赶紧趁它们回来之前，解决掉这些晕过去的源石虫，然后把它们的黏液收集起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......可是手电筒看起来已经坏了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "那就用你的法杖试一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......好吧......我先试试......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "黏液好像......还是原来的样子，没变化啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "要不要再试一次......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "嗯......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......这次呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "还是没有变......怎么回事？好像玛露西尔的魔法也变得断断续续的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "嗯......来到这里后我的魔力一直都是这种情况，好像只有在刚才成功使用手电筒的时候，我才感觉到魔力的来源很充足......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "老板之前说，D32钢能承载更大的能量输出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "D32钢手电筒可能有某种增幅效果......直接使用闪光魔法的话，不论是魔力大小还是威力都不够。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "也就是说，我还是需要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "......莱欧斯，不要再玩源石虫啦！你听懂她在说什么了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这种时候只需要按玛露西尔说的做就好了，这部分是她最擅长的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "——我明白了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克&莱欧斯",
      "text": "明白什么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "仅靠我自己如今的魔力和法杖，是没法施展出威力足够的闪光魔法让黏液变成你们想要的东西的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "只有使用具有高传导性的D32钢来大幅度地增强我释放的魔法的威力，才能让黏液产生变化——也就是说，再这样试下去也是没用的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我们还是需要手电筒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "感觉用这个冒烟的东西再加上闪光魔法，我们会和这些源石虫一样晕过去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "喂！！我有那么差劲吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你们能这样聚在一起讨论，也是因为我刚刚用手电筒把黏液变得可以吃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......唉，我刚觉得自己理解了一点这里的魔法原理，手电筒就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "这个什么手电筒看起来并没有被黏液腐蚀，那个什么D32钢应该就是这种银色的金属吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "按玛露西尔刚才说的，起作用的是这个D32钢，那么不论它的外形是什么样都可以用来释放魔法吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......嗯？按理说应该是这样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你们怎么突然问这种问题？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你们看我干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "啊啊！手电筒！我的手电筒！！住手！别用它来打锅啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "我们做出黄金萝卜，就能快点找到罗德岛，就能早点回去救法琳了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "别难过啦，你们不是也用我的开锁工具掏宝箱怪的肉吃吗？",
